        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the future of mining!<br><br>You <strong>THE MINER</strong>  operate a remote controlled miner-unit for limitless profit. Gather resources, upgrade your miner-unit and smelt a variety of precious metals. Mine deeper and you will encounter unexpected underground enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break? Take it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need something to do while waiting for a match in another game? Do some mining in between! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out some low urgency casual gameplay, and forget about the problems of the world with this simple mining platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GO MINING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie single developer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 10-24hrs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asset is made by hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-lines like you have never experienced before</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original relaxing blues inspired tunes (for the most part)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Demo (2-3hrs) available</p></li></ul>",
